{#
  Incidents and damage (§6.23), on the « État des lieux » page since #708
  (IT-17): observed during the stay — description, estimated amount, photo
  — until the departure inventory is validated; decided at any time, since
  deciding is about billing, not about what was seen. Three states (#980):
  under assessment, billed, not billed, each choice saying what it does.

  The fields that belong to one choice carry `data-incident-field` (the
  values they serve, space-separated) and start hidden unless they serve
  the current state; rental-inventory.js shows them as the choice changes.
  Hidden fields still post, so switching back and forth loses nothing.

  Requires `incidents`, `incident_decisions`, `incidents_open`, `asset` and
  `booking`.
#}
        <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h5 mb-2">Incidents et dégâts</h2>
                <p class="text-body-secondary small">
                    Rien n'est facturé automatiquement. Vous constatez, puis vous tranchez : en cours
                    d'évaluation, facturer, ou ne pas facturer. Tant que rien n'est facturé, aucun montant
                    n'est demandé au locataire ; le PDF de l'état des lieux de sortie liste ce qui a été
                    constaté, sans montant.
                </p>

                {% if incidents is empty %}
                    {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
                        message: 'Aucun incident.',
                        compact: true,
                    } only %}
                {% else %}
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                        {% for incident in incidents %}
                            {% set current = incident.decision.value %}
                            <li class="border-bottom py-2" id="incident-{{ incident.id }}">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-2">
                                    <span>
                                        {{ incident.description }}
                                        {% if incident.fileId %}
                                            <a href="{{ file_url(incident.fileId) }}" class="small d-block">Photo</a>
                                        {% endif %}
                                        {% if incident.awaiting or incident.reference %}
                                            <span class="small text-body-secondary d-block">
                                                {% if incident.awaiting %}
                                                    En attente de : {{ incident.awaiting }}
                                                {% endif %}
                                                {% if incident.awaiting and incident.reference %} · {% endif %}
                                                {% if incident.reference %}
                                                    Référence : {{ incident.reference }}
                                                {% endif %}
                                            </span>
                                        {% endif %}
                                        {% if incident.waiveReason %}
                                            <span class="small text-body-secondary d-block">
                                                Motif : {{ incident.waiveReason }}
                                            </span>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="text-end">
                                        <span class="visually-hidden">État actuel :</span>
                                        {% include 'partials/status_badge.html.twig' with {
                                            status: incident.isDecided ? 'closed' : 'pending',
                                            label: incident.decision.label,
                                        } only %}
                                        {# Only a charge counts in the settlement: an amount next to
                                           « En cours d'évaluation » or « Ne pas facturer » would read as owed. #}
                                        {% if current == 'charge' and incident.effectiveAmountCents %}
                                            <span class="d-block small" data-incident-amount>
                                                {{ incident.effectiveAmountCents|money_cents }}
                                            </span>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                                <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/incident-decision" class="mt-2"
                                      data-incident-decision>
                                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                                    <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_page" value="inventory">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="incident_id" value="{{ incident.id }}">
                                    <fieldset class="mb-2">
                                        <legend class="small fw-semibold mb-1">Décision</legend>
                                        {% for option in incident_decisions %}
                                            {% set choice_id = 'decision-' ~ incident.id ~ '-' ~ option.value %}
                                            <div class="form-check">
                                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="decision"
                                                       id="{{ choice_id }}" value="{{ option.value }}"
                                                       aria-describedby="{{ choice_id }}-help"
                                                       {{ current == option.value ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                                                <label class="form-check-label" for="{{ choice_id }}">
                                                    {{ option.label }}
                                                    {% if current == option.value %}
                                                        <span class="text-body-secondary small">(état actuel)</span>
                                                    {% endif %}
                                                </label>
                                                <div class="form-text mt-0" id="{{ choice_id }}-help">
                                                    {{ option.consequence }}
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        {% endfor %}
                                    </fieldset>
                                    <div class="row g-2 align-items-end">
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-5" data-incident-field="pending"
                                             {{ current != 'pending' ? 'hidden' : '' }}>
                                            <label class="form-label small mb-0" for="awaiting-{{ incident.id }}">
                                                En attente de…
                                            </label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm"
                                                   id="awaiting-{{ incident.id }}" name="awaiting" maxlength="200"
                                                   placeholder="Devis, expertise, assurance du locataire"
                                                   value="{{ incident.awaiting }}">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-4" data-incident-field="pending"
                                             {{ current != 'pending' ? 'hidden' : '' }}>
                                            <label class="form-label small mb-0" for="reference-{{ incident.id }}">
                                                Référence
                                            </label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm"
                                                   id="reference-{{ incident.id }}" name="reference" maxlength="100"
                                                   placeholder="N° de dossier"
                                                   value="{{ incident.reference }}">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-7 col-md-3" data-incident-field="pending charge"
                                             {{ current == 'waive' ? 'hidden' : '' }}>
                                            <label class="form-label small mb-0" for="amount-{{ incident.id }}">
                                                Montant (€)
                                            </label>
                                            <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" class="form-control form-control-sm"
                                                   id="amount-{{ incident.id }}" name="amount"
                                                   value="{{ incident.effectiveAmountCents
                                                       ? (incident.effectiveAmountCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', '')
                                                       : '' }}">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9" data-incident-field="waive"
                                             {{ current != 'waive' ? 'hidden' : '' }}>
                                            <label class="form-label small mb-0" for="waive-reason-{{ incident.id }}">
                                                Motif
                                            </label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm"
                                                   id="waive-reason-{{ incident.id }}" name="waive_reason"
                                                   maxlength="500"
                                                   placeholder="Facultatif, jamais montré au locataire"
                                                   value="{{ incident.waiveReason }}">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-5 col-md-3">
                                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary w-100">
                                                Trancher
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </form>
                            </li>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                {% endif %}

                {% if incidents_open %}
                <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/incident" enctype="multipart/form-data"
                      class="row g-2 align-items-end mt-2">
                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                    <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_page" value="inventory">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-5">
                        <label class="form-label" for="incident-description">Constater un incident</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="incident-description"
                               name="description" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-2">
                        <label class="form-label" for="incident-amount">Montant estimé (€)</label>
                        <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" class="form-control form-control-sm"
                               id="incident-amount" name="amount">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                        <label class="form-label" for="incident-photo">Photo</label>
                        <input type="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="incident-photo"
                               name="photo" accept="image/*">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-2">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary w-100">Ajouter</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
                {% else %}
                    <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">
                        L'état des lieux de sortie est validé : un incident ne se constate plus. Ceux déjà
                        constatés se tranchent toujours.
                    </p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
